<title>UK: Liverpool cotton sees slow trade.</title>
<headline>Liverpool cotton sees slow trade.</headline>
<dateline>LIVERPOOL 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buyers and sellers were taken aback by Monday's sharp fall on US futures but little fresh business resulted as the drop was not seen as enough to make asking prices for US cotton fully competitive.</p>
<p>Trading was slow and inquiry mostly to test pricing ideas.</p>
</text>
